1. Create tab → content-front.js loads → after 2.5s, extract data → send frontCapture → background handler processes
2. Wait 10s total to be safe
3. Close tab (data already processed)

For existing tabs:
1. Send frontCheck command → content-front.js re-extracts data → send frontCapture
2. Wait 5s
3. Move on

This is simple and should work. Let me implement it.

